WEBVTT

00:04.200 --> 00:05.360
Young General Zu,

00:05.440 --> 00:06.840
Pardon my presumption.

00:08.680 --> 00:09.480
Father,

00:09.560 --> 00:10.960
How about this:

00:11.240 --> 00:12.800
Why not call this a contest for my hand in marriage?

00:12.880 --> 00:14.280
Zu Yue!

00:15.360 --> 00:16.760
You carry on like a wild brigand!

00:17.120 --> 00:18.040
Before His Highness—

00:18.120 --> 00:20.120
Have you no decorum?!

00:22.440 --> 00:24.320
His Majesty arrives!
